  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.83,
      337.63,
      455.86,
      375.5
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 3 of the Economic Service Charge Act, No. 13 of2006 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect of the sectionas amended is to allow the insurer carrying on the general insurance business to deduct theservice charge levied from the income tax payable by such insurer.",
