  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.83,
      385.63,
      455.99,
      413.9
    ],
    "text": "Clause 3 : This clause amends section 9 of the principal enactment and the legal effect ofthe section as amended is to bring the time bar provision to make assessment or additionalassessment in line with section 106 of the Inland Revenue Act, No. 10 of 2006.",
