    ],
    "text": "3.Section 9 of the principal enactment as last amendedby Act, No. 15 of 2007 is hereby further amended by therepeal of subsection (4) of that section and the substitutiontherefor of the following:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
